B.a9H=new A.cR("Where it lives","In a NO SUS folder in your own Google Drive. NO SUS can open only the files it creates there, so connecting does not let it see the rest of your Drive.",!1)
B.a9B=new A.cR("Adding to it","Open Chat, then You. Type a note or attach a file. You can also share something to NO SUS from another app: it opens Send with You already picked.",!1)
B.a9W=new A.cR("Before Drive is connected","What you add waits on this phone as Not saved yet, and is stored as soon as you connect.",!1)
