B.a9y=new A.cR("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.aa_=new A.cR("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
B.a9L=new A.cR("After the session","Ending the session stops that screen from opening anything else. Files you downloaded or printed there can stay on it, so use a screen you trust.",!0)
