B.a9D=new A.cR("How it opens","For a link, turn on one of: One open, Watermarked, or Traceable copies. Each one says what it does right under it.",!1)
B.a9p=new A.cR("Opening a link or code","Send \u2192 Open a link or code. Codes work once and expire.",!1)
B.aa4=new A.cR("Sending nearby","Sending between two phones on the same Wi-Fi was removed. Send a link instead.",!1)
