B.aah=new A.iE("one-open","One open","A note or file that is gone after the first person opens it. No account needed on either end.",B.wo,B.als,B.aod)
B.wl=new A.aU(61170,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9o=new A.cR("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.a9Q=new A.cR("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.a9l=new A.cR("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The name on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
