B.aab=new A.iE("groups","Groups","A group chat for files, with its own members and activity. You join by invite.",B.ab6,B.afJ,B.apG)
B.aa1=new A.cR("Members can","Read every file in the group, add their own, rename and delete what they added, and see the group\u2019s activity.",!1)
B.a9P=new A.cR("Admins can also","Promote and demote members, remove and ban people, delete any file, manage invite links, and delete the group.",!1)
B.aa5=new A.cR("How it is enforced","By the database, not the app. The check runs on the server on every change, so an edited app gets a refusal, not a shortcut.",!1)
B.apn=s([B.aa1,B.a9P,B.aa5],t.eH)
