B.a9n=new A.cR("Adding","Open a group \u2192 Add a group file, or Send a file to the group. Everyone in the group can read it.",!1)
B.aa2=new A.cR("Reading","Tap a file to open it in the protected viewer. Chat \u2192 All files lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.aa6=new A.cR("Touch to reveal","The page stays blurred until you hold your finger on it, which stops the person behind you. Turn it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.",!1)
B.a9Y=new A.cR("What this does not do","Group files are not end-to-end encrypted. They are stored on our server and access is checked by database rules. For that, send a One open link instead: it is encrypted on your phone.",!0)
