B.a9N=new A.cR("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a9i=new A.cR("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a9r=new A.cR("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
