B.a9q=new A.cR("What you can hear about","Invites and join requests, role changes, admin actions that affect you, files added to your groups, a one-open link you sent being opened, and security alerts (your account was locked, or a screen connected to it). Turn each one off in Settings \u2192 Notifications.",!1)
B.a9X=new A.cR("Nothing sensitive on the lock screen","A notification names the group and what kind of thing happened, never a file\u2019s name or what it says.",!1)
B.a9t=new A.cR("If you said no to the permission","Android asks once. Everything still shows under the bell in the app, and Settings \u2192 Notifications has a button to open the system setting.",!1)
